{
  "default": true,
  "locale": "en",
  "scene": "scn_gny3t8sq",
  "schema": "patter/strings@0",
  "strings": {
    "L_0gewemiv": "Will you stay in this windswept place?",
    "L_0lu4y0kt": "Why continue to punish yourself for what happened so long ago?",
    "L_0xvl550u": "I haven't seen that key in a very long time. It brings back memories... good memories. Memories of what could have been.",
    "L_18kykl3i": "You can't be serious...",
    "L_1kdg38lq": "Then don't you think they'd understand? You've done plenty to earn your peace, Theo.",
    "L_1ltvs1g5": "How long have you been out here?",
    "L_1pcx2n33": "How can I face them? My parents, my grandparents. Tell me how am I to face them after failing them?",
    "L_1td5i88e": "What do you mean?",
    "L_254pjkf1": "You reach into your pocket and pull out the rusted old key. It might have once been ornate but with time its lustre has dimmed a bit. ",
    "L_2byiz0qg": "Why stay here though?",
    "L_2h24z2a6": "Its okay. Go see them. They're waiting for you.",
    "L_2xskv8uj": "What will you reflect on?",
    "L_33xlzqlw": "It's time for a new chapter, and you're eager to take up the mantle of the lighthouse keeper, with all of its responsibilities.",
    "L_3my1lr2g": "Why stay here though?  ",
    "L_3qtmd7vf": "The apparition looks up to the store, confused at first. But after a moment its eyes widen in disbelief.",
    "L_3s23qi5g": "Theo then disappears completely. The only things left in this place are yourself, the sound of the ocean and a slight breeze disappearing off into the distance.",
    "L_49exti52": "You're an odd duck.",
    "L_4fa7v880": "I insist. Lets go for a walk in town.",
    "L_4rkjhqby": "As you turn you see him. An ethereal young man stands before you. He is tall and broad chested dressed in a vest and slacks. He slumps slightly as he towers over you. His head hangs low and his shoulders slouched. You can't make out his face but you feel his stare. ",
    "L_5y4b677l": "I'm not sure. Time moves so slowly here... And yet decades can go by in an instant. I've watched over this town the whole time. I've seen multiple generations pass. Children growing into grandparents. And each cycle reminds me of my failure...",
    "L_65lzicca": "...",
    "L_718eixl7": "You can hardly be blamed for that.",
    "L_7i5avrta": "Glass vial",
    "L_84mf1odz": "Who are you?",
    "L_88xus0uu": "Fine... I can tell you won't let this go. Lead on.",
    "L_8ldn9lk4": "Surely it must be better than sitting out here? Reminding yourself of how you died.",
    "L_8n935pbu": "So you intend to just sit here and punish yourself for eternity?",
    "L_8vsnlvz3": "There is nothing for you here. Best to head back.  ",
    "L_8ykz79qz": "No... No, I don't think so... This whole thing has got me thinking... I've wallowed in this place long enough. Now its time for another group of  Montgomerys to feed this town. And I'm happy knowing that I could be here to see it. Thank you...",
    "L_9mqz7xoo": "The last little flame keeping our foothold to our home. I have a new duty now.",
    "L_9u78mxyw": "Maybe that why I chose to come this way on that night. It hadn't been 2 weeks since I buried by father. 'Heartsickness from my mother's passing the year prior', they said. I was yearning for a simpler time. So I walked the cliffs as I did back then...",
    "L_9um5evet": "The wind continues to howl like before: 'Go back home. You do not belong in this place.' ",
    "L_a3ahhmb2": "Have you never thought to see the town as it is now?  ",
    "L_a82nswqe": "Your sense of place",
    "L_aqpahzqg": "I insist. Lets go for a walk in town.  ",
    "L_aqwtfo76": "Why? You sitting on this rock isn't going to make it better. There's nothing for it but to move on.",
    "L_arlhn3o2": "The apparition begins to fade from view. He takes no notice of you as you reach out to try and stop him. He just mutters to himself.",
    "L_asqgxqo2": "You know nothing about me or my family.",
    "L_ayuu2x8q": "Theo then disappears into the wind. A gust pushes you back away from the cliff. Theo's home is amongst the crags of the shoreline. His vigil everlasting... Such is the legacy of the Montgomery family.",
    "L_bmxkbhrq": "The apparition then begins to fade from view. With a tired smile he nods to you before finally disappearing completely.",
    "L_bt2y0vfk": "Mermaid Lighter",
    "L_c6oi4riy": "The ghost is gone from this place. There is nothing left for you here.",
    "L_cua946ka": "Your penance is paid, Theo.",
    "L_d1z6wajd": "Move on",
    "L_dalio096": "It's not. So long as I can I will stay here. It's what I deserve.",
    "L_danwhdez": "They will understand I'm sure. You do not need to linger here punishing yourself any longer, Theo.",
    "L_dm8d4mwo": "The windmill still stands today, just barely visible from here. Obscured by newer buildings in town. This old key once went to its doors, but by this point the locks have surely changed. Now this old key is nothing but a memory of a time when the town was just beginning to form.",
    "L_ds3wrobu": "I failed them all...",
    "L_dsbuimlv": "I feel like they'd want to see you",
    "L_ef1ujo0p": "A stupid way to die. A dishonourable way. A way not fitting the weight I held. The trust my ancestors left to me. I squandered it. Now there is nothing.",
    "L_fh0ag060": "Of course...",
    "L_gckwsese": "Speaking of which... It's late, my friend. The wind gets dangerous here at night.",
    "L_gcupcyt4": "...",
    "L_h5fwq28x": "This is my duty.... and I will see it through.",
    "L_h9m86pt9": "... If it weren't for me I might still have descendants running around. Great great grand children proudly upholding the name Montgomery. These rocks are my penance. I stay to remind myself of all I've done.",
    "L_hdmlwmke": "So you intend to just sit here and punish yourself for eternity?",
    "L_hhbj7djj": "Still the design on its handle is distinct: a depiction of a famous local windmill from the early 1800s sits within a wreath of wheat. Below is a ribbon with the name Montgomery etched inside. Only just legible as the years wear and tear have taken hold.",
    "L_hxtfc8rb": "Yet we can't change the past... What's done is done. The Montgomerys are no more.",
    "L_ilh8yn8t": "True. But if I was a parent watching my child put themself through this, I'd be pretty upset.",
    "L_itikmlb9": "... I think you're right... Thanks... thanks for talkin', friend.",
    "L_j0sl0cql": "And this key, it means something to you?",
    "L_j2ts291l": "You're wrong. I need to stay... I must make up for my mistakes. I've taken it upon myself to guard these cliffs. So no other wayward soles make the same terrible mistake I made.",
    "L_jjs1l3js": "The apparition hesitates for a moment. Before his tense demeanour melts away with a sign. His eyes meet yours as he begins to fade from view.",
    "L_k3g8v4d5": "Were you a Montgomery?",
    "L_kx4yx8lq": "...",
    "L_l0bcw964": "Well... it's not all bad.",
    "L_lf5xupsf": "Eventually you reach the plot in which the windmill is set and make your way along its border, into town. After a minute or so you stop in front of an old wooden storefront.",
    "L_lpu7qv0s": "You walk a mile or so. In the distance an old windmill in surprisingly good condition stands proudly. But with each step closer you feel an icy chill from behind you. The anxiety welling up within Theo chills you to your very core. ",
    "L_m2ewo5h9": "At one time... it meant everything.",
    "L_ml32by0k": "You know of my family? ...That's right. Guardians of the ol' windmill. Family stretching back 8 generations. And all the while the grain we milled filled the bellies of the town. Not a stretch to say if my ancestors weren't around there might not be a town here.",
    "L_mp6o5p6l": "The feeling of isolation is palpable out here, even with the edge of town in sight. The only noise the rushing wind above and the crashing sea beneath. You can't help but feel like an outsider looking in when you step all the way back and look at the sleepy little town behind you. ",
    "L_mpvklgx2": "Right on the edge. A liminal space. ",
    "L_mtd5mkvn": "You look up to the windmill on the hill as it begins to turn in the cool breeze.",
    "L_mwuknde0": "... I always thought I had done us in for good... but yet, my family endures in some way. I don't know what to say...",
    "L_nn2oojnd": "You wouldn't understand. I— I couldn't face them... on the other side. I wouldn't know what to say. How to ask their forgiveness.",
    "L_nrd4rsrn": "Want to return to your cliffside?",
    "L_orlsugel": "A voice whispers from behind you— low and with the unmistakable hint of melancholy.",
    "L_papcc2g4": "I feel like they'd want to see you",
    "L_pq05f08i": "Your penance is paid, Theo.",
    "L_q6o1oiuf": "You blink, and when you open your eyes, Theo has vanished. As you try to find him, the strong wind picks up once more. You catch yourself before you tumble backwards away from the cliff face.",
    "L_q6tkr4kt": "My family... I'm— I was the last. It was on these cliffs that my line ended. I was drunk and on a dare was walking along the edge. The wind picked up... and my family's legacy ended.",
    "L_qzmqdfkk": "Have you never thought to see the town as it is now? ",
    "L_r8z63i2j": "Linger...",
    "L_r9z6za30": "You're wrong friend... I must stay here.",
    "L_rldhu02u": "Your hand finds the engraved lighter.",
    "L_sp6clmpl": "You take out the glass vial.",
    "L_sqy4o4jj": "Legacy takes many forms. A local baker recently purchased the land where your windmill stood. They're a lover of history as it were and felt like they would honour your family by not only using the windmill but also naming their new company after its original owners. The Montgomerys still feed the people of this town. Even now.",
    "L_suk7brcu": "You do, in fact, belong in this place. At least, you do now. You have left the bustle of the city for this isolation by choice. After you got laid off, there was nothing to keep you there. No family, few friends. The close ones will stay in touch and the others will move on.",
    "L_swj3484d": "The wind rebels against your steps as you walk out onto the rocky cliff face. The spray of the waves below is fresh in the air as they just barely crest over the steep ledge. ",
    "L_t81o2avu": "A bakery? Wh- Montgomery Mill Baking Company? But how is this possible? My parents had passed before me and I died without kids. The Montgomery name should be all but dead...",
    "L_tx2zc6ah": "Soon though the wind settles for but a moment, giving you a view of the ocean from on high. This is about as far from the city you can get without making an unfortunate decent to the churning water below.",
    "L_u7rxvp4u": "They loved you?",
    "L_udamx04r": "You want to see them too, yeah?",
    "L_ux3t4f92": "I wanted you to see something. Look at this building",
    "L_vccta3yn": "Really gives you scope of how small life in this little town is. Yet as soon at you take a few moments of this quiet contemplation in the wind howls up again. Pushing against you and away from the cliff. As if to tell you: 'Go back home. You do not belong in this place.'",
    "L_vcoe0rup": "Return to the lighthouse",
    "L_vjus2jiw": "My name is... Theo. I don't have much of an opportunity to use it these days.",
    "L_wcwfiu09": "I am. I have something I'd like to show you. I think it will be helpful for you.",
    "L_ww4b4473": "Why? The town has nothing for me now. I— It will only remind me of what I threw away.",
    "L_xb5m0msp": "... I do.",
    "L_xe5fe95t": "'Cause I can't bear to see it.",
    "L_xm4d8z1w": "Rusty Key",
    "L_y2ninfuz": "Then why do you linger here and not at the old mill?",
    "L_zfyh9fz9": "You gain nothing from torturing yourself like this.",
    "L_zttn744n": "... Why have we come here?",
    "L_zuhls44v": "I always loved coming out to these cliffs as a kid. Feeling the wind pushing against me. Back when I had less to worry about.",
    "L_zw8z5i1h": "The crashing waves make you uneasy. Time to go.",
    "L_zwh8c0ok": "Don't you see though? That's just it. I can't move on.... if I do then there truly WILL be nothing. I am the last spark of our legacy. ",
  },
}
